      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Protein S deficiency (PSD) may be associated with thrombotic events, including venous and arterial thrombosis. Most commonly, superficial and deep venous thrombosis have been noted. We report a case of acute myocardial infarction resulting from coronary thrombosis in a young male with PSD."},
